<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>back it up</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Letoa, lilbubblegum</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">back it up</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3JCck3dAyxJm8Kls1nf88Q</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.800" end="00:09.300" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Supreme)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.480" end="00:10.040" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ay, fuck you Letoa, you ain't shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.040" end="00:11.730">Yeah, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.730" end="00:14.990">Yeah, ay, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.990" end="00:16.980">Ba-ba-back it up (what?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.980" end="00:18.930">Gang want gas with us (want gas)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.930" end="00:20.980">My fit black as fuck (so black)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.980" end="00:22.980">Cash big, bag it up (bag, bag)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.980" end="00:24.920">Ain't know other do it like me (what?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.920" end="00:27.210">One bad bitch make a wifey (whoa)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.210" end="00:29.060">All these other dudes, they don't like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.060" end="00:31.010">'Cause I got the cash, yeah, it might be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.010" end="00:32.970">Off a whole lot of gas and shit (ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.970" end="00:34.980">Hoe with some massive lips (whoa)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.980" end="00:36.720">Shawty a bad lil' bitch (what?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.720" end="00:38.970">Whole lot of gas in the whip</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.970" end="00:40.470">I get the cash and I dip</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.400" end="00:42.320">Tap me a gat, spray lot of rats</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.320" end="00:44.360">I spend my band and I make it right back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.360" end="00:46.790">Shawty on me and she wanna get back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.790" end="00:48.290">She gon' back it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.550" end="00:49.080">I bring the MAC, ain't noo glizzy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.080" end="00:51.100">That girl, she gobble that glizzy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.100" end="00:53.100">I got like two, three thots</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.100" end="00:55.090">With some legs like Tory be litty (skrrt)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.090" end="00:57.110">You can see me in my city, makin' money, so I'm busy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.110" end="00:59.090">I'ma pull up with a strap on a opp (pow, pow)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.090" end="01:00.590">Choppa singin' like Wayne leaving bread like Trick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.060" end="01:03.120" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, aye, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.120" end="01:05.140">Ride around town in a new whip (skrrt)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.140" end="01:07.170">I just spent a rack on a new fit (that's facts)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.170" end="01:09.110">Whole gang in the back like a adlib (ha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.110" end="01:11.120">Pull up super fast and we blast them (pow, pow)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.120" end="01:13.050">Gettin' to the bag and I'm coolin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.050" end="01:14.850">People yellin', "Slatt," they be stupid (slatt)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.850" end="01:16.770">Use to hate, now I'm up, it's amusin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.770" end="01:24.770">But I be feeling like I'm Chi-Chi 'cause I'm ruthless (ha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.930" end="01:31.670">Yeah, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.670" end="01:34.850">Yeah, ay, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.850" end="01:36.890">Ba-ba-back it up (what?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.890" end="01:38.770">Gang want gas with us (want gas)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.770" end="01:40.730">My fit black as fuck (so black)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.730" end="01:42.920">Cash big, bag it up (bag, bag)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.920" end="01:44.920">Ain't know other do it like me (what?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.920" end="01:46.960">One bad bitch make a wifey (whoa)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.960" end="01:48.880">All these other dudes, they don't like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.880" end="01:51.200">'Cause I got the cash, yeah, it might be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.200" end="01:53.070">Ba-ba-back it up (what?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.070" end="01:55.450">Gang want gas with us (want gas)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.450" end="01:57.660">My fit black as fuck (so black)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.660" end="02:00.360">Cash big, bag it up (bag, bag)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.360" end="02:02.550">Ain't know other do it like me (what?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.550" end="02:04.740">One bad bitch make a wifey (whoa)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.740" end="02:07.180">All these other dudes, they don't like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.180" end="02:09.520">'Cause I got the cash, yeah, it might be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.520" end="02:11.740">Off a whole lot of gas and shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.740" end="02:14.110">Hoe with some massive lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.110" end="02:16.360">Shawty a bad lil' bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.360" end="02:18.620">Whole lot of gas in the whip</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.620" end="02:20.430">I get the cash and I dip</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.430" end="02:24.430">Tap me a gat, spray lot of rats</p></div></body></tt>